{"speciesId":276,"names":{"fr":"Nirondelle","es":"Taillow","en":"Taillow","ja":"スバメ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"TAILLOW courageously stands its ground against foes, however strong they may be. This gutsy POKéMON will remain defiant even after a loss. On the other hand, it cries loudly if it becomes hungry."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"TAILLOW is young - it has only just left its nest. As a result, it sometimes becomes lonesome and cries at night. This POKéMON feeds on WURMPLE that live in forests."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"Although it is small, it is very courageous. It will take on a larger SKARMORY on an equal footing. However, its will weakens if it becomes hungry."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It dislikes cold seasons. They migrate to other lands in search of warmth, flying over 180 miles a day."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It dislikes cold seasons. They migrate to other lands in search of warmth, flying over 180 miles a day."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It has a gutsy spirit that makes it bravely take on tough foes. It flies in search of warm climates."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It has a gutsy spirit that makes it bravely take on tough foes. It flies in search of warm climates."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It has a gutsy spirit that makes it bravely take on tough foes. It flies in search of warm climates."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"When it gets cold, they migrate, flying over 180 miles a day. It hunts for tasty prey."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"When it gets cold, they migrate, flying over 180 miles a day. It hunts for tasty prey."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Ce Pokémon téméraire n’a pas peur d’affronter des ennemis puissants. Il vole en quête de climats chauds."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It has a gutsy spirit that makes it bravely take on tough foes. It flies in search of warm climates."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Ce Pokémon téméraire n’a pas peur d’affronter des ennemis puissants. Il vole en quête de climats chauds."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It has a gutsy spirit that makes it bravely take on tough foes. It flies in search of warm climates."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It has a gutsy spirit that makes it bravely take on tough foes. It flies in search of warm climates."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It has a gutsy spirit that makes it bravely take on tough foes. It flies in search of warm climates."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ce Pokémon téméraire n’a pas peur d’affronter des ennemis puissants. Il vole en quête de climats chauds."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Es un Pokémon valiente que no teme a los rivales fuertes. Vuela en busca de climas templados."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It has a gutsy spirit that makes it bravely take on tough foes. It flies in search of warm climates."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"強い 相手にも 勇敢に 立ち向かう 根性の 持ち主。 暖かい 土地を 目指して 飛ぶ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Nirondelle ne supporte pas les saisons froides. Il vole vers d’autres terres à la recherche de chaleur et peut ainsi parcourir 300 km par jour."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"No le gustan las bajas temperaturas. En las estaciones frías se recorre casi 300 km al día en busca de zonas cálidas."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It dislikes cold seasons. They migrate to other lands in search of warmth, flying over 180 miles a day."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"寒い 季節は 苦手。暖かい 土地を 探し １日 ３００キロの 距離を 飛んで 移動する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Nirondelle défend courageusement son territoire contre ses ennemis, même les plus puissants. Ce vaillant Pokémon est toujours prêt à relever un défi, mais s’il a faim, il se met à pleurer à chaudes larmes."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Taillow se mantiene firme ante sus rivales, sean lo fuertes que sean. Este valiente Pokémon seguirá mostrándose desafiante, aunque pierda en combate. Además, si se enfada, se pondrá a gritar con energía."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Taillow courageously stands its ground against foes, however strong they may be. This gutsy Pokémon will remain defiant even after a loss. On the other hand, it cries loudly if it becomes hungry."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"どんな 強い 相手でも 勇敢に 挑む。 負けても へこたれない 根性の 持ち主。 お腹が 空くと 大声で 泣いて しまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Nirondelle est jeune. Il vient de quitter son nid. Du coup, il se sent parfois un peu seul et pleure la nuit. Ce Pokémon se nourrit des Chenipotte qu’il trouve dans les forêts."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Taillow es pequeño, está recién salido del nido. Por eso, se siente solo con frecuencia y se pone a piar. Este Pokémon se alimenta de los Wurmple que hay por el bosque."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Taillow is young—it has only just left its nest. As a result, it sometimes becomes lonesome and cries at night. This Pokémon feeds on Wurmple that live in forests."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"巣立ちを 終えたばかり なので 夜に なると 寂しく なって 泣いてしまう ことも ある。 森に すむ ケムッソを 捕まえて 食べる。"}],"varieties":[{"id":276,"moves":[{"name":"wing-attack","learns":[[5,"level-up",13],[6,"level-up",13],[7,"level-up",13],[8,"level-up",13],[9,"level-up",13],[10,"level-up",13],[11,"level-up",13],[12,"level-up",13],[13,"level-up",13],[14,"level-up",13],[15,"level-up",13],[16,"level-up",13],[17,"level-up",13],[18,"level-up",13],[23,"level-up",13]]},{"name":"whirlwind","learns":[[8,"egg",0],[9,"egg",0],[10,"egg",0],[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[23,"egg",0]]},{"name":"fly","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[